From 4f02f638041258ed70f0fc3908e4077e3f60f640 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Joeri Van Dooren <ure@on6ure.be>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 12:19:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] api: refuse requests other sites can make a browser send
 (OpenX6X00)

Pat has no login, and a plain GET of /api/connect keys the transmitter.
The HTTP server's handler is wrapped in a guard:

- nothing that came through Tailscale Funnel, from the internet:
  tailscaled's serve proxy marks such a request with a
  Tailscale-Funnel-Request header, and Pat stays on the radio's network
  and the tailnet whatever is funneled by mistake;
- the Host header must be an IP address, localhost, the hostname,
  <hostname>.local, <hostname>.<domain> for a domain the radio's network
  gives it (the search and domain lines of /etc/resolv.conf, which
  NetworkManager writes; not a domain that is a public suffix alone,
  such as nl or co.uk), a name listed in /mnt/own_names.conf (the web
  configurator's Network page), end in .ts.net, or be the radio's
  MagicDNS short name (the first part of name= in /run/tailscale/status,
  x6200-1 when the tailnet still has an earlier card's machine as
  x6200), the names the web configurator takes (no DNS rebinding);
- for /api/ and /ws, an Origin header, when present, must name the same
  host:port as Host, and Sec-Fetch-Site, when present, must be
  same-origin or none;
- what changes something (/api/connect and /api/disconnect on any
  method, every API request that is not a GET or HEAD) must also come
  with an Origin or jQuery's X-Requested-With, which Pat's page sends:
  an <img> or a link on another site reaches a plain http:// LAN address
  with neither Origin nor Sec-Fetch-Site, and cannot add that header
  without a CORS preflight that carries its Origin;
- 403 otherwise. Pages are sent with X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 api/api.go        |   2 +-
 api/guard.go      | 274 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 api/guard_test.go | 211 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 486 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 api/guard.go
 create mode 100644 api/guard_test.go

